 {
  "title": "PG 連線池設定",
  "create_time": 1786515600,
  "update_time": 1786528920,
  "conversation_id": "f14-pg-pool",
  "current_node": "f14-pg-pool-12",
  "mapping": {
   "root": {
    "id": "root",
    "parent": null,
    "children": [
     "f14-pg-pool-1"
    ],
    "message": null
   },
   "f14-pg-pool-1": {
    "id": "f14-pg-pool-1",
    "parent": "root",
    "children": [
     "f14-pg-pool-2"
    ],
    "message": {
     "id": "f14-pg-pool-1",
     "author": {
      "role": "user"
     },
     "recipient": "all",
     "create_time": 1786515600,
     "content": {
      "content_type": "text",
      "parts": [
       "PgBouncer 要用哪種 pool mode？我們是 Django + Postgres，尖峰大概 300 個連線。"
      ]
     },
     "metadata": {}
    }
   },
   "f14-pg-pool-2": {
    "id": "f14-pg-pool-2",
    "parent": "f14-pg-pool-1",
    "children": [
     "f14-pg-pool-3"
    ],
    "message": {
     "id": "f14-pg-pool-2",
     "author": {
      "role": "assistant"
     },
     "recipient": "all",
     "create_time": 1786515900,
     "content": {
      "content_type": "text",
      "parts": [
       "建議用 transaction mode。session mode 每個用戶端佔一條伺服器連線，撐不住 300 個。"
      ]
     },
     "metadata": {}
    }
   },
   "f14-pg-pool-3": {
    "id": "f14-pg-pool-3",
    "parent": "f14-pg-pool-2",
    "children": [
     "f14-pg-pool-4"
    ],
    "message": {
     "id": "f14-pg-pool-3",
     "author": {
      "role": "user"
     },
     "recipient": "all",
     "create_time": 1786517520,
     "content": {
      "content_type": "text",
      "parts": [
       "max_connections 要跟 pool size 一起調嗎？"
      ]
     },
     "metadata": {}
    }
   },
   "f14-pg-pool-4": {
    "id": "f14-pg-pool-4",
    "parent": "f14-pg-pool-3",
    "children": [
     "f14-pg-pool-5"
    ],
    "message": {
     "id": "f14-pg-pool-4",
     "author": {
      "role": "assistant"
     },
     "recipient": "all",
     "create_time": 1786517880,
     "content": {
      "content_type": "text",
      "parts": [
       "不用。max_connections 留 100 就夠；PgBouncer 的 default_pool_size 先設 20，讓連線在 PgBouncer 這一層排隊。"
      ]
     },
     "metadata": {}
    }
   },
   "f14-pg-pool-5": {
    "id": "f14-pg-pool-5",
    "parent": "f14-pg-pool-4",
    "children": [
     "f14-pg-pool-6-old",
     "f14-pg-pool-6"
    ],
    "message": {
     "id": "f14-pg-pool-5",
     "author": {
      "role": "user"
     },
     "recipient": "all",
     "create_time": 1786527300,
     "content": {
      "content_type": "text",
      "parts": [
       "壓到 200 連線時開始出現 lock wait，要怎麼查？"
      ]
     },
     "metadata": {}
    }
   },
   "f14-pg-pool-6": {
    "id": "f14-pg-pool-6",
    "parent": "f14-pg-pool-5",
    "children": [
     "f14-pg-pool-7"
    ],
    "message": {
     "id": "f14-pg-pool-6",
     "author": {
      "role": "assistant"
     },
     "recipient": "all",
     "create_time": 1786527360,
     "content": {
      "content_type": "text",
      "parts": [
       "先看 pg_stat_activity 的 wait_event，再對照 pg_locks 找出擋住別人的那筆交易。"
      ]
     },
     "metadata": {}
    }
   },
   "f14-pg-pool-6-old": {
    "id": "f14-pg-pool-6-old",
    "parent": "f14-pg-pool-5",
    "children": [],
    "message": {
     "id": "f14-pg-pool-6-old",
     "author": {
      "role": "assistant"
     },
     "recipient": "all",
     "create_time": 1786527360,
     "content": {
      "content_type": "text",
      "parts": [
       "先重新開機 PgBouncer 試試看。"
      ]
     },
     "metadata": {}
    }
   },
   "f14-pg-pool-7": {
    "id": "f14-pg-pool-7",
    "parent": "f14-pg-pool-6",
    "children": [
     "f14-pg-pool-8"
    ],
    "message": {
     "id": "f14-pg-pool-7",
     "author": {
      "role": "user"
     },
     "recipient": "all",
     "create_time": 1786527600,
     "content": {
      "content_type": "text",
      "parts": [
       "找到了，卡在 orders 表的外鍵檢查。"
      ]
     },
     "metadata": {}
    }
   },
   "f14-pg-pool-8": {
    "id": "f14-pg-pool-8",
    "parent": "f14-pg-pool-7",
    "children": [
     "f14-pg-pool-9"
    ],
    "message": {
     "id": "f14-pg-pool-8",
     "author": {
      "role": "assistant"
     },
     "recipient": "all",
     "create_time": 1786527840,
     "content": {
      "content_type": "text",
      "parts": [
       "外鍵欄位沒有索引時，刪除父表的列要掃整張子表。先在子表的外鍵欄位補索引。"
      ]
     },
     "metadata": {}
    }
   },
   "f14-pg-pool-9": {
    "id": "f14-pg-pool-9",
    "parent": "f14-pg-pool-8",
    "children": [
     "f14-pg-pool-10"
    ],
    "message": {
     "id": "f14-pg-pool-9",
     "author": {
      "role": "user"
     },
     "recipient": "all",
     "create_time": 1786528200,
     "content": {
      "content_type": "text",
      "parts": [
       "應用端還要注意什麼？"
      ]
     },
     "metadata": {}
    }
   },
   "f14-pg-pool-10": {
    "id": "f14-pg-pool-10",
    "parent": "f14-pg-pool-9",
    "children": [
     "f14-pg-pool-11"
    ],
    "message": {
     "id": "f14-pg-pool-10",
     "author": {
      "role": "assistant"
     },
     "recipient": "all",
     "create_time": 1786528500,
     "content": {
      "content_type": "text",
      "parts": [
       "transaction mode 下不能用 server-side prepared statements，Django 要關掉 server-side cursor。"
      ]
     },
     "metadata": {}
    }
   },
   "f14-pg-pool-11": {
    "id": "f14-pg-pool-11",
    "parent": "f14-pg-pool-10",
    "children": [
     "f14-pg-pool-12"
    ],
    "message": {
     "id": "f14-pg-pool-11",
     "author": {
      "role": "user"
     },
     "recipient": "all",
     "create_time": 1786528800,
     "content": {
      "content_type": "text",
      "parts": [
       "幫我整理最後的設定。"
      ]
     },
     "metadata": {}
    }
   },
   "f14-pg-pool-12": {
    "id": "f14-pg-pool-12",
    "parent": "f14-pg-pool-11",
    "children": [],
    "message": {
     "id": "f14-pg-pool-12",
     "author": {
      "role": "assistant"
     },
     "recipient": "all",
     "create_time": 1786528920,
     "content": {
      "content_type": "text",
      "parts": [
       "default_pool_size 20、transaction mode，應用端關掉 prepared statements。之後再壓測一次確認。"
      ]
     },
     "metadata": {}
    }
   }
  }
